        "name": "mkinney",
        "email": "mike.kinney@gmail.com",
        "date": "2026-11-22T11:38:21Z"
      },
      "message": "fix(2d): Pass starts at (Auto/Inside/Outside) for Bore\n\nBore takes the shared pass_start parameter of #3316. The ring ladder of\neach level is ordered by PassStart::rank through the new motion entry\nbore_started. Auto keeps the centre-out walk byte for byte. Outside cuts\nthe wall ring first and walks in. Inside is the centre-out order, because\na hole has no inner wall.\n\nThe field rides EditOperationParams, the MCP edit_operation door and the\nproject key pass_start (auto never written). The Bore Passes tab shows the\nshared row with a Bore hint.\n\nStacked on #3353.\n\nFixes #3360\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
