      },
      "message": "fix(motion): rework Bore pass start onto the shared warning law\n\nMerge origin/main (e313aa663, the #3353 merge) into the branch.\n\nBlocker 1: the merged main removed PassStart::rank, so bore.rs no longer\ncompiled (E0599). Order the bore rings directly from PassStart: Auto and\nInside keep the centre-out walk, and Outside reverses it to cut the wall\nring first. Auto stays byte-for-byte identical.\n\nBlocker 2: bore Outside cuts the wall ring at the full tool width. The\nfamily warning law of #3402 (#3316) needs a note for it. bore_started now\nadds StartSide::wall_first_note() to the path notes for Outside, and posts\nnone for Auto and Inside. The note does not change the moves.\n\nPinned by bore_outside_names_the_full_width_wall_cut.\n\nRefs #3360\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>",
